Deckmark scripts (theme.mjs, decklint.mjs) mirror the design of Hallmark's theme.mjs and sloplint.mjs:
frontmatter themes, a seeded dealer rotated against a project log, a structural draw, and a linter with
FAIL / REFLEX tiers, on-the-record waivers and a real-browser tier.
Hallmark is MIT licensed, Copyright (c) 2026 Hallmark contributors. No Hallmark code is copied verbatim
except small helpers (seeded random, project salt, log write) adapted under that licence.
Theme midnight (references/themes/midnight.md) is adapted from Hallmark's midnight theme (palette, fonts, material), MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 Hallmark contributors.
Theme vantage (references/themes/vantage.md) is adapted from Hallmark's vantage theme (palette, fonts, corner-tick frame), MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 Hallmark contributors.
Theme console (references/themes/console.md) is adapted from Hallmark's console theme (palette, fonts, hairline panels), MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 Hallmark contributors.
Theme newsprint is adapted from Hallmark's newsprint theme (palette and type tokens), MIT licence, Copyright (c) 2026 Hallmark contributors.
Theme editorial is adapted from Hallmark's editorial theme (palette and type tokens), MIT licence, Copyright (c) 2026 Hallmark contributors.
Theme vellum is adapted from Hallmark's vellum theme (palette and type tokens), MIT licence, Copyright (c) 2026 Hallmark contributors.
Theme ink is adapted from Hallmark's ink theme (palette and type tokens), MIT licence, Copyright (c) 2026 Hallmark contributors.
Theme specimen is adapted from Hallmark's specimen theme (palette and type tokens), MIT licence, Copyright (c) 2026 Hallmark contributors.
